description=Network bench: Tailscale and EasyTier mesh VPNs, per-app internet blocking, TCP tuning (BBR/cake), ADB over Wi-Fi, and a VoLTE/VoWiFi toggle, all from a WebUI. Uses its own iptables chain so it stays out of other modules' way.
